cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "WaveDude Rust"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform 2D wave-equation simulator written in Rust:
  scenes from images and optical parts, point and composite sources,
  field and intensity views, probes with live graphs, and video export.
authors:
  - family-names: Bencz
    given-names: Lajos
repository-code: "https://github.com/lajosbencz/WaveDudeRust"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.3.8
date-released: "2026-11-17"
keywords:
  - wave equation
  - wave simulation
  - finite difference
  - optics
  - photonics
  - Rust
